            "review_title": "Review at Vit 29 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Bingham\nPhoenix, Arizona3 contributions\n0\nDuck yum so yummy!\nDec 2018\nTraveling abroad you should already know the setting is not much like the western part of the world. The duck is the most tasting duck I have had in most places. I have been to thousands around the world. They roast the duck over coal and reseason it with the original duck grease with more seasoning. Crispy juicy bites every time, so good ate with my bard hands.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 30, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
