            "review_title": "Review at Vit 29 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "gerrymarkred\nManchester, United Kingdom83 contributions\n0\nIf its duck your after this is the place\nJan 2018 • Family\nA restaurant which only does duck......26 different ways using every part of the duck that's possible. They serve all dishes with homemade pickled onions and sauce made from duck juices and insides of duck. Only the chef knows how to make the sauce, when he's not there the place closes!!!. Add lots of herbs like duck basil (spearmint / aniseed flavour) and off you go to duck heaven\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 4, 2018",
