            "review_title": "Review at Vit 29 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "CocoArt_10\nToronto, Canada121 contributions\n0\nDUCK (vit) RESTAURANT (chain) one of several in Hanoi\nMar 2017\nWe were at the one on Nguyen Huu Huan near the corner of Luong Ngoc Quan. Easily found by the roasted duck hanging in the window. Luckily we ordered one of the whole ducks which was tender and moist but not so lucky with the fried duck which was tough and flavourless. The dipping sauce was really good as well as the dish of green onion ends in a light sauce.The sticky rice was good as was the tangy (mango?) salad. The waiter spoke english very well but said he only worked there part time so it is a good thing the menu has photos to point at.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 5, 2017",
