            "review_text": "artalmon\nKampala, Uganda621 contributions\n0\nHalf a duck, when you are not hungry\nApr 2015 • Solo\nLast night I felt a little appetite before going home. Checking out Nonna Chong's Hanoi Street Food Map (https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?ll=21.065919,105.836964&msa=0&spn=0.04237,0.077162&mid=zCkf8fj9cT_Y.kQf4L_R22G-g ) I decided to have some duck at VIT 29, #29 Nguyễn Thượng Hiền, Hoàn Kiếm. I went for the half roasted duck and didn't regret it. Delicious!! \nSit downstairs, its less hot and better ventilated. If you are a bigger group, go upstairs.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 29, 2015",
