            "review_text": "gungho25\n37 contributions\n0\nIf you like duck, this is the place\nAug 2014 • Business\nMy colleague and I went to Vit 29 on Nguyen Huu Han Street branch for lunch and had their roast duck. It was very tasty and it only costed us about US$ 8 dollars for half a duck with beers and beverages. They have English menu full of duck dishes, salads and other delicacies.\n\nIf you are a duck lover, this is a must place for you.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 26, 2014",
